Build only ICU4X's codegen tool (icu_capi's generated FFI code, icu_properties'
enum values). (ICU4X 2.4's codegen needs no compiled data. Since Chromium 159, the
baked data comes from Chromium's own icu4x_datagen, not ICU4X's bakeddata.)

